       In Linux 0.98p4, a call _u_m_o_u_n_t_(_d_i_r_) was  added,  in  order  to  support
       anonymous  devices.   In Linux 2.3.99‐pre7, the call _u_m_o_u_n_t_(_d_e_v_i_c_e_) was
